            "rationale": "prove.sh first proves BIND-SPEC.bind-int-name with #Top using BIND-BASE, which imports only VERIFICATION-SUMMARIES and therefore excludes this VERIFICATION-CORE rule; the claim has the same guarded target-binding map transition and arbitrary continuation.",
            "source_rule_id": "rule-31a6bac2bd8050884a7695b95e2da949d3afd1ffa512f6f540b7e70fa7be7fd8",
            "start_line": 56,
            "text": "  rule <k> #bindTgt(Name(X:String), I:Int) => .K ... </k>\n       <env> L:Int </env>\n       <scopes>\n         ... L |-> scope(M:Map => M [ X <- I ], P:Parent) ...\n       </scopes>\n       requires notBool (\"$cells\" in_keys(M))\n       [priority(40)]"
        },
        {
            "attributes": [
                "priority(40)"
            ],
            "classification": "PROVED_DERIVED_LEMMA",
            "end_line": 114,
            "module": "VERIFICATION",
            "normalized_sha256": "59ce8f7a5a66c78d9a389f0872a48ebbc7e48b3ebf905673b33bee12077a79e5",
            "rationale": "prove.sh first proves LOOP-SPEC.rolling-loop-connection with #Top using LOOP-BASE, whose closure imports VERIFICATION-CORE but excludes this VERIFICATION rule; the claim exactly matches the loop body, continuation, guard, cells, and summary transition.",
            "source_rule_id": "rule-59ce8f7a5a66c78d9a389f0872a48ebbc7e48b3ebf905673b33bee12077a79e5",
            "start_line": 71,
            "text": "  rule\n    <k>\n      #loop(\n        list(IS:ValSeq),\n        Name(\"number\"),\n        If(\n          Compare(Name(\"number\"), CmpOp(\">\", Name(\"current\"))),\n          Assign(Name(\"current\"), Name(\"number\")) .Stmts,\n          .Stmts)\n        Expr(Call(\n          Attribute(Name(\"result\"), \"append\"),\n          (Name(\"current\"), .Exprs))) .Stmts)\n      ~> .Stmts\n      ~> Return(Name(\"result\")) .Stmts\n      ~> #endcall\n      =>\n      .Stmts\n      ~> Return(Name(\"result\")) .Stmts\n      ~> #endcall\n    </k>\n    <env> 1 </env>\n    <scopes>\n      0 |-> scope(MODULE:Map, parent(-1))\n      1 |-> scope(\n        \"current\" |-> (M:Int => foldMax(M, IS))\n        \"number\"  |-> (D:Int => lastOr(D, IS))\n        \"numbers\" |-> list(ORIGINAL:ValSeq)\n        \"result\"  |-> ref(0),\n        parent(0))\n      -1 |-> BUILTINS:Scope\n    </scopes>\n    <scopeLoc> 2 </scopeLoc>\n    <heap>\n      0 |-> list(A:ValSeq => rollAcc(A, M, IS))\n    </heap>\n    <heapLoc> 1 </heapLoc>\n    <stack>\n      ListItem(frame(.K, 0, 1))\n    </stack>\n    <ret> noRet </ret>\n    <exc> NoExc </exc>\n    <exit-code> 0 </exit-code>\n    requires allInts(IS)\n    [priority(40)]"
        }
    ],
